LLVM original floating-value path audit, 2026-09-16.
This is a source audit, not a new native campaign. Every listed original has
a PASS Clang-19 ARM64 control in the existing 20260915T152557Z lit-baseline.
The ledger preserves each original command and source SHA256; raw outcomes
and the full 1735-program denominator are unchanged. No diagnostic-code
mapping or unused floating declaration alone establishes applicability.

